## User Interface & User Experience (UI/UX)

The ETSU Marketplace application is designed with a focus on usability, accessibility, and responsiveness to provide a seamless experience for all users.

### Design Approach
The interface uses a clean layout with consistent design patterns and clear visual hierarchy, making it easy for users to navigate and interact with the system.

### Responsive Design
Bootstrap is used to ensure responsiveness across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.

### Navigation
The application uses a structured navigation bar that allows users to easily access:
- Listings
- Create Listing
- Favorites
- Messaging

### Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 Considerations)
- Semantic HTML elements are used
- Images include descriptive alt text
- Color contrast is considered for readability
- Forms include labels and validation messages
- Navigation is consistent and predictable

### User Interaction
Interactive features such as real-time messaging and dynamic search improve user engagement and reduce page reloads.

